{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Gravity 4</i>, the rules are simple: <strong>align four blocks vertically, horizontally, or diagonally to win.</strong><br>The board is divided by a central X-axis. When you click above the line, a block falls downward and locks onto the axis. When you click below the line, a block rises upward and locks from below. Every move is pulled by gravity toward the center, creating a new layer of strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s in the Demo</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core rule set: <strong>connect four with a twist of central gravity</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends (<strong>local multiplayer up to 4 players, with Remote Play Together</strong>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean, intuitive presentation</strong> designed for quick matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements and record tracking</strong> (wins, streaks, challenges)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable difficulty levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple block color palettes &amp; night mode</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned for Full Release</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global and local <strong>ranking system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded <strong>online</strong>\u00a0<strong>multiplayer</strong> support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh reinterpretation of the classic <i>connect four</i> formula, <i>Gravity 4</i> challenges you to think in new directions under the pull of central gravity.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3998730?t=1763813103","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3998730?t=1763813103","capsule_i